## ESS / Karama Business Center — Complete Technical SEO, On-Page SEO, Schema, Local SEO & Lead Generation

### 1. Your role and primary objective

Act as a senior technical SEO engineer, local SEO strategist, structured-data specialist, conversion-rate optimization expert, and experienced frontend developer.

The website and service pages have already been built, and the content for all pages is available. **Do not rebuild the website or replace existing content unnecessarily.** Audit the current implementation first, preserve working features, and improve what is missing or incorrect.

