Do not force the exact primary keyword into every heading. Use natural variations, terminology customers actually use, and the official service name where appropriate.

Identify keyword cannibalization by comparing page purpose, titles, H1s, content, internal links, and available Search Console query data. Recommend consolidation or differentiation only when the evidence supports it.

